      howToRun: 'Prayer + the anchor (5): pray; read Deuteronomy 22:8 twice. | The line in a sentence (10): safety is blood, not a line item. | Teach it (15): the four features — at construction, foreseeable, anonymous, blood on the house. | Work it (25): walk a property and write every foreseeable fall, burn, shock or carbon hazard, each with a date. | Discussion (10): which hazard have we been carrying with no date? | Send-off (5): solo task — remediate or schedule one, in writing, this week.',
